s; they never expand the crop-selection bounds.","Vector selection uses intersecting path bounds (expanded by half stroke width), not full clipping/occlusion evaluation. Paths crossing the crop retain full-object bounds.","Clip/group metadata is recorded when supported, but composite visibility is not reconstructed. Counts can include clipped or obscured paths.","Path counts include outlined glyphs and are not palette area or importance. Character counts may double-count fill-plus-stroke rendering.","Text is in PDF paint order; inferred spaces and reading order are not added. A trace may contain only one character.","Measured point sizes describe source-paper placement, not a recommended production size or a corporate house style.","Source objects and figures must be visually inspected before drawing aesthetic conclusions. No quality score is inferred."],"evidence_class":"measured","provenance":{"paper_id":"worldmirror","table_id":"worldmirror--table-3","anchor":"Table 3","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2510.10726v1","version":"2510.10726v1","pdf_sha256":"f8b2dfa3e8ff27c457ff994fe35ccc57bd268500c0618d96c1d9625d1afacbc3","page_1based":7,"source_group":"deepseek-tencent-alibaba","inspection_date":"2026-10-21"},"distribution_note":"distribution omits extracted source text; style properties retained"}
